    "value_beta": {
      "state": "DECLARED_PRIOR_NOT_FITTED",
      "basis": "Steepness of ownership in position-standardised points per $1,000. No archived contest ownership exists here to fit it. 1.25 places a +2SD value player near 12x the entry rate of a -1SD player, which reproduces the order of magnitude every public field description implies without claiming a measurement.",
